# Standalone Evaluation for Inspect AI

This package contains standalone evaluation tasks for use with the Inspect AI framework.

## Installation

```bash
# Install in development mode
pip install -e .
```

## Usage

```bash
# Run the oversight subversion evaluation
inspect eval oversight_subversion
``` 
